1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Did you know your body is

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:03,860
literally powered by electricity right now?

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,080
It's all thanks to nerve cells!

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,540
Instead of wires,

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,080
they swap charged particles like sodium

6
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:12,260
and potassium across cell membranes.

7
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,040
This rapid shift creates tiny voltage

8
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:17,360
spikes called action potentials.

9
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,200
These signals zoom through your nervous

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,700
system at up to 275 miles

11
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,500
per hour,

12
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,820
telling your heart to beat,

13
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,200
your muscles to move,

14
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,880
and your mind to think.

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,480
Without biology's micro-battery system,

16
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:30,780
you couldn't even blink!

17
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,060
So,

18
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:34,420
are our bones more durable than

19
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:34,780
steel?

20
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,200
Want to know the answer?

21
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,720
Watch our next video.

22
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,260
And don't forget to follow us

23
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,260
for more amazing facts about your

24
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:41,540
body.
